note Opposing Forces — v1.4 fractal governance demo
note Every control has an equal and opposite.
note Every set of four (A, B, C, C') is governed by a meta-control.
note The meta-control has its own equal and opposite.
note The structure fractal-repeats at every level.

note ── The two primary states ──

event not knowing
category state
matter
  name is not knowing
  description is the starting condition of ignorance or incompetence
  energy is low
  direction is away from mastery
end
end

event knowing
category state
matter
  name is knowing
  description is the arrived condition of mastery and fluency
  energy is high
  direction is toward mastery
end
end

note ── Level 1: zoom in reveals the primary control ──

zoom in on not knowing and knowing into learning process

note learning process is what bridges not-knowing to knowing
note it is the discipline, repetition, feedback loop that pulls you forward

note ── Level 1 opposite: zoom opposite reveals the counter-force ──

zoom opposite on learning process into resistance

note resistance is the equal and opposite of learning process
note procrastination, perfectionism, fear — the force pushing back toward not-knowing
note without resistance there is no tension — the learning process loses meaning

note ── Level 2: zoom meta reveals what governs all four ──

zoom meta on not knowing and knowing and learning process and resistance into learning environment

note learning environment governs all four:
note  - it determines how hard not-knowing feels
note  - it determines how far knowing seems
note  - it determines the strength of the learning process
note  - it determines the strength of resistance
note examples: sleep quality, psychological safety, mentors, urgency, stakes

note ── Level 2 opposite: the meta-control has its own equal and opposite ──

zoom opposite on learning environment into environment collapse

note environment collapse is what destroys even the governing conditions
note burnout, isolation, depression, toxic context — the meta-resistance
note when environment collapse wins, learning process and resistance both stop mattering

note ── Now we can zoom meta again — Level 3 ──

zoom meta on learning environment and environment collapse into life conditions

note life conditions govern whether learning environment can even exist
note examples: financial stability, physical health, relationships, meaning
note this is the second-order meta-control — the field that generates the field

note ── Show the full governance structure ──

run not knowing
run knowing
run learning process
run resistance
run learning environment
run environment collapse
run life conditions
